<title>UK: SBC launch warrants on German banks basket.</title>
<headline>SBC launch warrants on German banks basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schweizerische Bankverein (Deutscheland) said it has issued two million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on a German banks basket.</p>
<p>The basket includes 30 shares of Commerzbank AG, 20 shares of Dresdner Bank AG and 10 shares of Deutsche Bank AG.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 30.JUL.97-02.JUL.99   PAYDATE	30.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, DUSSELDORF     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  4,800 DEM</p>
<p>* * * * * *</p>
<p>		STRIKE	ISSUE	PREMIUM     GEARING</p>
<p> CALL	 4,800 DEM   9.37 DEM   19.52 PCT   5.12 X</p>
<p> CALL	 5,000 DEM   8.56 DEM   22.00 PCT   5.61 X</p>
<p>NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE    SBYA</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
